ar יָצֹר Isa 11:13 ; Infinitive absolute צָרוֺר Num 25:17 ; Participle active צֹרֵר 10:9 , plural suffix צֹרֲרי Psa 31:12 +, etc.; — shew hostility toward, treat with enmity, vex, harass , with accusative of person Isa 11:13 ; Num 10:9 ; 25:17 ; once with ל person 25:18 ; also participle as substantive (construct or with suffix) vexer, harasser , Amos 5:12 ; Isa 11:13 ; Exod 23:22 (E), Psa 6:8 ; 7:5 ; 7:7 ; 8:3 ; 10:5 ; 23:5 ; 31:12 ; 42:11 ; 69:20 ; 74:4 ; 74:23 ; 143:12 ; Est 3:10 ; 8:1 ; 9:10 , 24 . &#8212; Lev 18:18 see [ צָרַר ] below II. צָרָה , below [ צָרַר ] verb denominative make a rival-wife ; — Qal Infinitive construct לִצְרֹר Lev 18:18 to make [her] a rival-wife (Lag GGN, 1882, 406 Dr-Wh Lv Baen l. v ). III. צרר (√ of following; compare Arabic be sharp (? denominative), , sharp-edged hard stone , Assyrian ƒurtu , apparently knife RJHarper BAS ii. 435 ; Syriac rock, stone, flint ).","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 8 37","keyReferences":["1Kgs 8 37","1Sam 25 29","1Sam 28 15","2Chr 28 22","2Chr 33 12","2Kgs 5 23","2Sam 1 26","2Sam 20 3"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":53,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 8 37","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":37,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יָֽצַר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVhi3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 25 29","book":"1Sam","chapter":25,"verse":29,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צְרוּרָ֣ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqsfsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 28 15","book":"1Sam","chapter":28,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צַר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp3ms"},{"reference":"2Chr 28 22","book":"2Chr","chapter":28,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָצֵ֣ר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVhc"},{"reference":"2Chr 33 12","book":"2Chr","chapter":33,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/כְ/הָצֵ֣ר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Vhc"},{"reference":"2Kgs 5 23","book":